                onClick=${() => setSelected(record)}>
                <span class="paper-title">${window.space.field(record, 'title') || 'Untitled'}</span>
                <span class="paper-meta"><${StatusBadge} record=${record} /><${PriorityBadge} record=${record} />${record.data.demo && html`<span class="space-badge space-badge--archived">Demo</span>`}</span>
              </button>
            </li>`)}</ul>` :
            html`<${EmptyState} title=${records.length ? 'No matching papers' : 'Your library is empty'}>
              <p>${records.length ? 'No paper matches that search. Your library still has ' + records.length + ' papers.' : 'Add a paper above, or use Refresh once it is permitted in this Space\'s Permissions.'}</p>
              ${records.length ? html`<button type="button" onClick=${() => setSearch('')}>Clear search</button>` : null}<//>`}
        </div>
